project "Subscribers Thank You"
cartridge "SUBSCRIBERS/AMY STUDIO/2026"
memory "colecovision_legacy_sdcc"

' Amy port inspired by old-projects-sdcc-z80/sdcctest/subscribers.
' 2009 thank-you demo for the newcoleco YouTube channel subscribers.
' It keeps the original screen, BIOS music table, NMI equalizer, and real icon art.

